\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. See isreal's gentle shepherd stand
\par With all-engaging charms;
\par Hark how He calls the tender lambs
\par And folds them in His arms!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Permit  them to approach, He cries,
\par Nor scorn their humble name;
\par For 'twas to bless such soul as these
\par The Lord of angels came.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. We bring them, Lord, in thankful hands,
\par And yield the up to Thee:
\par Joyful that we ourselves are Thine,
\par Thine let our children be. 
\par Amen\lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

